          "title": "Berkeley Fair Chance: no criminal history inquiry or exclusionary advertising",
          "requirement": "Rental housing providers may not inquire about criminal history, or indicate in advertisements, application materials or verbally that persons with criminal backgrounds will not be considered. They may not require disclosure of criminal history or authorization to release it.",
